[
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 1,
    "content": [
      { "heading": "The Invasion of Locusts" },
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "This is the word of the " },
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      " that came to Joel son of Pethuel:"
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 2,
    "content": [
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "Hear this, O elders;", "break": true },
      { "text": "and give ear, all who dwell in the land.", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "Has anything like this ever happened in your days",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "or in the days of your fathers?", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 3,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Tell it to your children;", "break": true },
      { "text": "let your children tell it to their children,", "break": true },
      { "text": "and their children to the next generation.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 4,
    "content": [
      { "text": "What the devouring locust has left,", "break": true },
      { "text": "the swarming locust has eaten;", "break": true },
      { "text": "what the swarming locust has left,", "break": true },
      { "text": "the young locust has eaten;", "break": true },
      { "text": "and what the young locust has left,", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "the destroying locust has eaten.",
        "foot": {
          "type": "stu",
          "content": "The precise identification of the four kinds of locusts mentioned here is uncertain."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 5,
    "content": [
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "Wake up, you drunkards, and weep;",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "wail, all you drinkers of wine,", "break": true },
      { "text": "because of the sweet wine,", "break": true },
      { "text": "for it has been cut off from your mouth.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 6,
    "content": [
      { "text": "For a nation has invaded My land,", "break": true },
      { "text": "powerful and without number;", "break": true },
      { "text": "its teeth are the teeth of a lion,", "break": true },
      { "text": "and its fangs are the fangs of a lioness.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 7,
    "content": [
      { "text": "It has laid waste My grapevine", "break": true },
      { "text": "and splintered My fig tree.", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "It has stripped off the bark and thrown it away;",
        "break": true
      },
      "the branches have turned white."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 8,
    "content": [
      { "heading": "A Call to Mourning" },
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "Wail like a virgin dressed in sackcloth,",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "grieving for the husband of her youth.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 9,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Grain and drink offerings have been cut off", "break": true },
      "from the house of the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": ";", "break": true },
      { "text": "the priests are in mourning,", "break": true },
      "those who minister before the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": ".", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 10,
    "content": [
      { "text": "The field is ruined;", "break": true },
      { "text": "the land mourns.", "break": true },
      { "text": "For the grain is destroyed,", "break": true },
      { "text": "the new wine is dried up, and the oil fails.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 11,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Be dismayed, O farmers,", "break": true },
      { "text": "wail, O vinedressers,", "break": true },
      { "text": "over the wheat and barley,", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "because the harvest of the field has perished.",
        "break": true
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 12,
    "content": [
      { "text": "The grapevine is dried up,", "break": true },
      { "text": "and the fig tree is withered;", "break": true },
      { "text": "the pomegranate, palm, and apple—", "break": true },
      { "text": "all the trees of the orchard—are withered.", "break": true },
      "Surely the joy of mankind has dried up."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 13,
    "content": [
      {
        "heading": {
          "text": "A Call to Repentance",
          "foot": {
            "type": "xrf",
            "content": [
              { "bibleLink": "Amos 5:4–15" },
              "; ",
              { "bibleLink": "Zephaniah 2:1–3" },
              "; ",
              { "bibleLink": "Luke 13:1–5" }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "Put on sackcloth and lament, O priests;",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "wail, O ministers of the altar.", "break": true },
      { "text": "Come, spend the night in sackcloth,", "break": true },
      { "text": "O ministers of my God,", "break": true },
      { "text": "because the grain and drink offerings", "break": true },
      { "text": "are withheld from the house of your God.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 14,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Consecrate a fast;", "break": true },
      { "text": "proclaim a solemn assembly!", "break": true },
      { "text": "Gather the elders", "break": true },
      { "text": "and all the residents of the land", "break": true },
      "to the house of the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " your God,", "break": true },
      "and cry out to the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      "."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 15,
    "content": [
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "Alas for the day!", "break": true },
      "For the Day of the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " is near,", "break": true },
      { "text": "and it will come", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "as destruction from the Almighty.",
        "break": true,
        "foot": {
          "type": "trn",
          "content": ["Hebrew ", { "text": "Shaddai", "marks": ["i"] }]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 16,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Has not the food been cut off", "break": true },
      { "text": "before our very eyes—", "break": true },
      { "text": "joy and gladness", "break": true },
      { "text": "from the house of our God?", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 17,
    "content": [
      { "text": "The seeds lie shriveled beneath the clods;", "break": true },
      { "text": "the storehouses are in ruins;", "break": true },
      { "text": "the granaries are broken down,", "break": true },
      { "text": "for the grain has withered away.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 18,
    "content": [
      { "text": "How the cattle groan!", "break": true },
      { "text": "The herds wander in confusion", "break": true },
      { "text": "because they have no pasture.", "break": true },
      "Even the flocks of sheep are suffering."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 19,
    "content": [
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "To You, O " },
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": ", I call,", "break": true },
      { "text": "for fire has consumed the open pastures", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "and flames have scorched all the trees of the field.",
        "break": true
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 20,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Even the beasts of the field pant for You,", "break": true },
      { "text": "for the streams of water have dried up,", "break": true },
      "and fire has consumed the open pastures."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 1,
    "content": [
      {
        "heading": {
          "text": "The Army of Locusts",
          "foot": { "type": "xrf", "content": { "bibleLink": "Amos 7:1–9" } }
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "Blow the ram’s horn in Zion;",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "sound the alarm on My holy mountain!", "break": true },
      { "text": "Let all who dwell in the land tremble,", "break": true },
      "for the Day of the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " is coming;", "break": true },
      { "text": "indeed, it is near—", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 2,
    "content": [
      { "text": "a day of darkness and gloom,", "break": true },
      { "text": "a day of clouds and blackness.", "break": true },
      { "text": "Like the dawn overspreading the mountains", "break": true },
      { "text": "a great and strong army appears,", "break": true },
      { "text": "such as never was of old,", "break": true },
      "nor will ever be in ages to come."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 3,
    "content": [
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "Before them a fire devours,",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "and behind them a flame scorches.", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "The land before them is like the Garden of Eden,",
        "break": true
      },
      {
        "text": "but behind them, it is like a desert wasteland—",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "surely nothing will escape them.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 4,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Their appearance is like that of horses,", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "and they gallop like swift steeds.",
        "break": true,
        "foot": {
          "type": "trn",
          "content": [
            "Or ",
            { "text": "like charioteers", "marks": ["i"] },
            " or ",
            { "text": "like cavalry", "marks": ["i"] }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 5,
    "content": [
      { "text": "With a sound like that of chariots", "break": true },
      { "text": "they bound over the mountaintops,", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "like the crackling of fire consuming stubble,",
        "break": true
      },
      "like a mighty army deployed for battle."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 6,
    "content": [
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "Nations writhe in horror before them;",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "every face turns pale.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 7,
    "content": [
      { "text": "They charge like mighty men;", "break": true },
      { "text": "they scale the walls like men of war.", "break": true },
      { "text": "Each one marches in formation,", "break": true },
      { "text": "not swerving from the course.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 8,
    "content": [
      { "text": "They do not jostle one another;", "break": true },
      { "text": "each proceeds in his path.", "break": true },
      { "text": "They burst through the defenses,", "break": true },
      { "text": "never breaking ranks.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 9,
    "content": [
      { "text": "They storm the city;", "break": true },
      { "text": "they run along the wall;", "break": true },
      { "text": "they climb into houses,", "break": true },
      "entering through windows like thieves."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 10,
    "content": [
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "Before them the earth quakes;",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "the heavens tremble.", "break": true },
      { "text": "The sun and moon grow dark,", "break": true },
      { "text": "and the stars lose their brightness.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 11,
    "content": [
      "The ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " raises His voice", "break": true },
      { "text": "in the presence of His army.", "break": true },
      { "text": "Indeed, His camp is very large,", "break": true },
      { "text": "for mighty are those who obey His command.", "break": true },
      "For the Day of the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " is great and very dreadful.", "break": true },
      "Who can endure it?"
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 12,
    "content": [
      { "heading": "Return with All Your Heart" },
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "“Yet even now,”", "break": true },
      "declares the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": ",", "break": true },
      { "text": "“return to Me with all your heart,", "break": true },
      "with fasting, weeping, and mourning.”"
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 13,
    "content": [
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "So rend your hearts and not your garments,",
        "break": true
      },
      "and return to the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " your God.", "break": true },
      { "text": "For He is gracious and compassionate,", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "slow to anger, abounding in loving devotion.",
        "break": true,
        "foot": {
          "type": "trn",
          "content": [
            "Forms of the Hebrew ",
            { "text": "chesed", "marks": ["i"] },
            " are translated here and in most cases throughout the Scriptures as ",
            { "text": "loving devotion", "marks": ["i"] },
            "; the range of meaning includes ",
            { "text": "love", "marks": ["i"] },
            ", ",
            { "text": "goodness", "marks": ["i"] },
            ", ",
            { "text": "kindness", "marks": ["i"] },
            ", ",
            { "text": "faithfulness", "marks": ["i"] },
            ", and ",
            { "text": "mercy", "marks": ["i"] },
            ", as well as ",
            { "text": "loyalty to a covenant", "marks": ["i"] },
            "."
          ]
        }
      },
      { "text": "And He relents from sending disaster.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 14,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Who knows? He may turn and relent", "break": true },
      { "text": "and leave a blessing behind Him—", "break": true },
      { "text": "grain and drink offerings", "break": true },
      "for the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      " your God."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 15,
    "content": [
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "Blow the ram’s horn in Zion,",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "consecrate a fast,", "break": true },
      { "text": "proclaim a sacred assembly.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 16,
    "content": [
      {
        "text": "Gather the people, sanctify the congregation,",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "assemble the aged, gather the children,", "break": true },
      { "text": "even those nursing at the breast.", "break": true },
      { "text": "Let the bridegroom leave his room,", "break": true },
      { "text": "and the bride her chamber.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 17,
    "content": [
      "Let the priests who minister before the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"], "break": true },
      { "text": "weep between the portico and the altar,", "break": true },
      "saying, “Spare Your people, O ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": ",", "break": true },
      { "text": "and do not make Your heritage a reproach,", "break": true },
      { "text": "an object of scorn among the nations.", "break": true },
      { "text": "Why should they say among the peoples,", "break": true },
      "‘Where is their God?’”"
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 18,
    "content": [
      { "heading": "Restoration Promised" },
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "Then the " },
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " became jealous for His land,", "break": true },
      "and He spared His people."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 19,
    "content": [
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "And the " },
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      " answered His people:",
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "“Behold, I will send you", "break": true },
      { "text": "grain, new wine, and oil,", "break": true },
      { "text": "and by them you will be satisfied.", "break": true },
      { "text": "I will never again make you", "break": true },
      "a reproach among the nations."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 20,
    "content": [
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "The northern army I will drive away from you,",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "banishing it to a barren and desolate land,", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "its front ranks into the Eastern Sea,",
        "break": true,
        "foot": { "type": "stu", "content": "That is, the Dead Sea" }
      },
      {
        "text": "and its rear guard into the Western Sea.",
        "break": true,
        "foot": {
          "type": "stu",
          "content": "That is, the Mediterranean Sea, also called the Great Sea"
        }
      },
      { "text": "And its stench will rise;", "break": true },
      "its foul odor will ascend.",
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "For He has done great things." }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 21,
    "content": [
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "Do not be afraid, O land;", "break": true },
      { "text": "rejoice and be glad,", "break": true },
      "for the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " has done great things.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 22,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Do not be afraid, O beasts of the field,", "break": true },
      { "text": "for the open pastures have turned green,", "break": true },
      { "text": "the trees bear their fruit,", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "and the fig tree and vine yield their best.",
        "break": true,
        "foot": {
          "type": "trn",
          "content": [
            "Literally ",
            { "text": "their strength", "marks": ["i"] }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 23,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Be glad, O children of Zion,", "break": true },
      "and rejoice in the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " your God,", "break": true },
      { "text": "for He has given you the autumn rains", "break": true },
      { "text": "for your vindication.", "break": true },
      { "text": "He sends you showers,", "break": true },
      { "text": "both autumn and spring rains, as before.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 24,
    "content": [
      { "text": "The threshing floors will be full of grain,", "break": true },
      "and the vats will overflow with new wine and oil."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 25,
    "content": [
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "I will repay you for the years eaten by locusts—",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "the swarming locust, the young locust,", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "the destroying locust, and the devouring locust",
        "foot": {
          "type": "stu",
          "content": "The precise identification of the four kinds of insects mentioned here is uncertain."
        }
      },
      { "text": "—", "break": true },
      { "text": "My great army that I sent against you.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 26,
    "content": [
      { "text": "You will have plenty to eat,", "break": true },
      { "text": "until you are satisfied.", "break": true },
      "You will praise the name of the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " your God,", "break": true },
      { "text": "who has worked wonders for you.", "break": true },
      { "text": "My people will never again", "break": true },
      { "text": "be put to shame.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 27,
    "content": [
      {
        "text": "Then you will know that I am present in Israel",
        "break": true
      },
      "and that I am the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " your God,", "break": true },
      { "text": "and there is no other.", "break": true },
      { "text": "My people will never again", "break": true },
      "be put to shame."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 28,
    "content": [
      {
        "heading": {
          "text": "I Will Pour Out My Spirit",
          "foot": { "type": "xrf", "content": { "bibleLink": "Acts 2:14–36" } }
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "And afterward, I will pour out My Spirit on all people.",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "Your sons and daughters will prophesy,", "break": true },
      { "text": "your old men will dream dreams,", "break": true },
      { "text": "your young men will see visions.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 29,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Even on My menservants and maidservants,", "break": true },
      { "text": "I will pour out My Spirit in those days.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 30,
    "content": [
      {
        "text": "I will show wonders in the heavens and on the earth,",
        "break": true
      },
      {
        "text": "blood and fire and columns",
        "foot": {
          "type": "var",
          "content": [
            { "abbr": "LXX" },
            " ",
            { "text": "clouds", "marks": ["i"] },
            " or ",
            { "text": "billows", "marks": ["i"] }
          ]
        }
      },
      { "text": " of smoke.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 31,
    "content": [
      { "text": "The sun will be turned to darkness", "break": true },
      { "text": "and the moon to blood", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "before the coming of the great and awesome",
        "foot": {
          "type": "var",
          "content": [
            "Or ",
            { "text": "dreadful", "marks": ["i"] },
            "; ",
            { "abbr": "LXX" },
            " ",
            { "text": "glorious", "marks": ["i"] }
          ]
        }
      },
      " Day of the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": ".", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 32,
    "content": [
      "And everyone who calls on the name of the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"], "break": true },
      {
        "text": "will be saved;",
        "break": true,
        "foot": {
          "type": "xrf",
          "content": [
            "Cited in ",
            { "bibleLink": "Acts 2:17–21" },
            " and ",
            { "bibleLink": "Romans 10:13" }
          ]
        }
      },
      { "text": "for on Mount Zion and in Jerusalem", "break": true },
      "there will be deliverance, as the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " has promised,", "break": true },
      "among the remnant called by the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      "."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 1,
    "content": [
      {
        "heading": [
          "The ",
          { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
          " Judges the Nations"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "“Yes, in those days and at that time,",
        "break": true
      },
      {
        "text": "when I restore Judah and Jerusalem from captivity,",
        "break": true,
        "foot": {
          "type": "trn",
          "content": [
            "Or ",
            {
              "text": "restore the fortunes of Judah and Jerusalem",
              "marks": ["i"]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 2,
    "content": [
      { "text": "I will gather all the nations", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "and bring them down to the Valley of Jehoshaphat.",
        "break": true,
        "foot": {
          "type": "stu",
          "content": [
            { "text": "Jehoshaphat", "marks": ["i"] },
            " means ",
            { "text": "the ", "marks": ["i"] },
            { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["i", "sc"] },
            { "text": " judges", "marks": ["i"] },
            "; also in verse 12."
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "There I will enter into judgment against them",
        "break": true
      },
      {
        "text": "concerning My people, My inheritance, Israel,",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "whom they have scattered among the nations", "break": true },
      { "text": "as they divided up My land.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 3,
    "content": [
      { "text": "They cast lots for My people;", "break": true },
      { "text": "they bartered a boy for a prostitute", "break": true },
      "and sold a girl for wine to drink."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 4,
    "content": {
      "paragraph": true,
      "text": "Now what do you have against Me, O Tyre, Sidon, and all the regions of Philistia? Are you rendering against Me a recompense? If you retaliate against Me, I will swiftly and speedily return your recompense upon your heads."
    }
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 5,
    "content": {
      "text": "For you took My silver and gold and carried off My finest treasures to your temples.",
      "foot": {
        "type": "trn",
        "content": ["Or ", { "text": "palaces", "marks": ["i"] }]
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 6,
    "content": [
      {
        "text": "You sold the people of Judah and Jerusalem to the Greeks,",
        "foot": {
          "type": "trn",
          "content": [
            "Or ",
            { "text": "to the peoples of Javan", "marks": ["i"] }
          ]
        }
      },
      " to send them far from their homeland."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 7,
    "content": {
      "paragraph": true,
      "text": "Behold, I will rouse them from the places to which you sold them; I will return your recompense upon your heads."
    }
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 8,
    "content": [
      "I will sell your sons and daughters into the hands of the people of Judah, and they will sell them to the Sabeans—to a distant nation.”",
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "Indeed, the " },
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      " has spoken."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 9,
    "content": [
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "Proclaim this among the nations:" },
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "“Prepare for war;", "break": true },
      { "text": "rouse the mighty men;", "break": true },
      { "text": "let all the men of war", "break": true },
      { "text": "advance and attack!", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 10,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Beat your plowshares into swords", "break": true },
      { "text": "and your pruning hooks into spears.", "break": true },
      { "text": "Let the weak say, ‘I am strong!’", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 11,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Come quickly, all you surrounding nations,", "break": true },
      { "text": "and gather yourselves.", "break": true },
      { "text": "Bring down Your mighty ones,", "break": true },
      "O ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      "."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 12,
    "content": [
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "Let the nations be roused", "break": true },
      { "text": "and advance to the Valley of Jehoshaphat,", "break": true },
      { "text": "for there I will sit down", "break": true },
      { "text": "to judge all the nations on every side.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 13,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Swing the sickle,", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "for the harvest is ripe.",
        "break": true,
        "foot": {
          "type": "var",
          "content": [
            { "abbr": "LXX" },
            " ",
            { "text": "the harvest has come", "marks": ["i"] },
            "; see also ",
            { "bibleLink": "Mark 4:29" },
            "."
          ]
        }
      },
      { "text": "Come, trample the grapes,", "break": true },
      { "text": "for the winepress is full;", "break": true },
      { "text": "the wine vats overflow", "break": true },
      "because their wickedness is great."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 14,
    "content": [
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "Multitudes, multitudes", "break": true },
      { "text": "in the valley of decision!", "break": true },
      "For the Day of the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " is near", "break": true },
      { "text": "in the valley of decision.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 15,
    "content": [
      { "text": "The sun and moon will grow dark,", "break": true },
      { "text": "and the stars will no longer shine.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 16,
    "content": [
      "The ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " will roar from Zion", "break": true },
      { "text": "and raise His voice from Jerusalem;", "break": true },
      { "text": "heaven and earth will tremble.", "break": true },
      "But the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " will be a refuge for His people,", "break": true },
      "a stronghold for the people of Israel."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 17,
    "content": [
      { "heading": "Blessings for God’s People" },
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "Then you will know that I am the " },
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      { "text": " your God,", "break": true },
      { "text": "who dwells in Zion, My holy mountain.", "break": true },
      { "text": "Jerusalem will be holy,", "break": true },
      "never again to be overrun by foreigners."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 18,
    "content": [
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "And in that day the mountains will drip with sweet wine,",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "and the hills will flow with milk.", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "All the streams of Judah will run with water,",
        "break": true
      },
      "and a spring will flow from the house of the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"], "break": true },
      {
        "text": "to water the Valley of Acacias.",
        "break": true,
        "foot": {
          "type": "trn",
          "content": ["Or ", { "text": "Valley of Shittim", "marks": ["i"] }]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 19,
    "content": [
      { "text": "Egypt will become desolate,", "break": true },
      { "text": "and Edom a desert wasteland,", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "because of the violence done to the people of Judah,",
        "break": true
      },
      { "text": "in whose land they shed innocent blood.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 20,
    "content": [
      { "text": "But Judah will be inhabited forever,", "break": true },
      { "text": "and Jerusalem from generation to generation.", "break": true }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "JOL",
    "chapter": 3,
    "verse": 21,
    "content": [
      { "text": "For I will avenge their blood,", "break": true },
      {
        "text": "which I have not yet avenged.”",
        "foot": {
          "type": "trn",
          "content": [
            "Or ",
            {
              "text": "For I will pardon their bloodguilt, which I have not yet pardoned.",
              "marks": ["i"]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      " For the ",
      { "text": "Lord", "marks": ["sc"] },
      " dwells in Zion."
